# Only send the files needed for the build to the build context
*
!.mvn/
!mvnw
!pom.xml
!src/

# Local secrets (e.g., `.env`, `.env.local`) must never reach the build, also
# not within the included paths
**/.env*
# Other common names of secret files
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/id_ecdsa*
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/.git-credentials
**/kubeconfig*
